---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Now" description="我最近在做什么 (/now)">
  <div class="cmd-label">$ uptime && ps aux | grep duty</div>
  <h1 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">~/now — 当前状态</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.75rem;">
    Last updated: 2026-11-09 · Inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;">nownownow.com</a>
  </p>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>近期专注</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>搭建并打磨这个极简终端风个人博客 <code>duty-blog</code>，使用 Astro + Cloudflare Pages 部署。</li>
      <li>持续记录边缘计算、分布式系统与日常开发中的实践笔记。</li>
      <li>保持低噪音输入与定期输出。</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>工具栈 (Uses)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Framework</strong>: Astro 5 (Static output, 0 KB default JS)</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting & Edge CDN</strong>: Cloudflare Pages</li>
      <li><strong>Typography</strong>: JetBrains Mono</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
